<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>只读分析登录｜W8M</title><link href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/css/w8m-account.css?v=20260801-3" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="w8m-public-account theme-internal"><main class="account-stage"><div class="container"><div class="account-card account-card-compact theme-internal"><aside class="account-context"><div class="account-context-copy"><p class="account-eyebrow">受控只读账户</p><h2>市场分析</h2><p>此入口只展示管理员明确授权的汇总报表，不能修改投放、路由、账户或结算数据。</p></div></aside><section class="account-form-panel"><div class="account-form-heading"><h1>只读分析登录</h1><p>请输入账户、密码以及已启用的双重验证码。</p></div>{{if .Errorstr}}<div class="account-alert">登录信息无效或会话已失效，请重试。</div>{{end}}<form method="post" action="/goto/analyst/g/{{.LoginName}}"><input type="hidden" name="{{.GoURIName}}" value="{{.GoURI}}"><div class="account-field"><label for="analyst-login">用户名</label><input id="analyst-login" class="form-control" name="{{.Login}}" autocomplete="username" required></div><div class="account-field"><label for="analyst-password">密码</label><input id="analyst-password" class="form-control" name="{{.Password}}" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></div><div class="account-field"><label for="analyst-totp">身份验证器验证码或恢复代码</label><input id="analyst-totp" class="form-control" name="{{.TOTP}}" autocomplete="one-time-code"></div><button type="submit" class="account-submit">登录只读工作台</button></form></section></div></div></main></body></html>
